{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125075327539-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125085726\"/><p>英皇道近書局街西行線電車服務一度暫停。</p><p>北角發生交通意外。今晨(25日)7時19分，一輛電車往西行駛經英皇道近琴行街時，撞倒一名過路婦，婦人受傷清醒，由救護車送往東區醫院治理，意外原因有待調查。受意外影響，在書局街的西行線電車服務一度暫停，至早上8時12分服務恢復正常。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:55.031113+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:53:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T01:37:25.929237+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T01:17:27.825041+00:00","content_hash":"60c254d60e102a8b500816e2162e0a860e8a31963827e20778286e43db942a7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}